-- title:
--   Coordinates for the local box of a ℤ-basis lattice
-- statement:
--   Let $D$ be a ring equipped with a $\mathbb{Q}$-algebra structure, let $\iota$ be a finite index type, and let $b \colon \iota \to D$ be a basis of $D$ as a $\mathbb{Q}$-vector space. Let $\Lambda$ be a $\mathbb{Z}$-submodule of $D$ which is assumed to be exactly the $\mathbb{Z}$-span of the range of $b$, i.e. $\Lambda = \sum_i \mathbb{Z}\, b_i$. Let $v$ be a point of the height-one spectrum of the ring of integers $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$ of $\mathbb{Q}$, write $\mathbb{Q}_v$ for the $v$-adic completion of $\mathbb{Q}$ and $\mathcal{O}_v \subseteq \mathbb{Q}_v$ for its subring of $v$-adic integers, and let $x \in D \otimes_{\mathbb{Q}} \mathbb{Q}_v$. The assertion is an equivalence: $x$ belongs to [`Submodule.localBox`](def/Submodule_LocalBox.html#L40) $\Lambda$ $v$, that is, to the additive subgroup of $D \otimes_{\mathbb{Q}} \mathbb{Q}_v$ generated by the set of elementary tensors $z \otimes c$ with $z \in \Lambda$ and $c \in \mathcal{O}_v$, if and only if there exists a family $c \colon \iota \to \mathbb{Q}_v$ with $c_i \in \mathcal{O}_v$ for every $i$ and $x = \sum_{i} b_i \otimes c_i$. No commutativity is assumed of $D$.
--
--   This is the coordinate description of the completion at a finite place of a lattice given by a $\mathbb{Z}$-basis: the local box $\Lambda_v$ is the free $\mathcal{O}_v$-module on the $b_i \otimes 1$, so membership is tested by $v$-integrality of coordinates. It is used in the local analysis of orders in a quaternion algebra over $\mathbb{Q}$, for instance to identify local boxes of maximal and Eichler orders with matrix or valuation rings up to conjugation, and is cited by the statements about Eichler orders and level structures in the Čerednik–Drinfeld tower material.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_Submodule_mem_localBox_iff_exists_eq_sum_basis_tmul.lean

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_Submodule_FiniteAdeleBox
import Definitions.Def_Submodule_LocalBox

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

open scoped TensorProduct
open IsDedekindDomain NumberField

theorem Submodule.mem_localBox_iff_exists_eq_sum_basis_tmul
    {D : Type*} [Ring D] [Algebra ℚ D] {ι : Type*} [Fintype ι]
    (b : Module.Basis ι ℚ D) (Λ : Submodule ℤ D) (hb : Submodule.span ℤ (Set.range b) = Λ)
    (v : HeightOneSpectrum (𝓞 ℚ)) (x : D ⊗[ℚ] v.adicCompletion ℚ) :
    x ∈ Submodule.localBox Λ v ↔
      ∃ c : ι → v.adicCompletion ℚ,
        (∀ i, c i ∈ v.adicCompletionIntegers ℚ) ∧ x = ∑ i, b i ⊗ₜ[ℚ] c i := by sorry
